OL,3,AEarnings limit of up to #140K for
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers loan scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds will need to earn less than
OL,7,F#110,000 to qualify for the
OL,8,Fgovernment's new loan scheme for
OL,9,Ffirst-time buyers, or #140,000 for
OL,10,Fhomes bought in London.
OL,12,FAs first reported by The Times, the
OL,13,Fearnings limits are expected to be
OL,14,Fconfirmed at the Budget next week.
OL,16,FThe Your First Home scheme will offer
OL,17,Fgovernment-backed equity loans worth
OL,18,F20% of new-build properties in England
OL,19,Fbought from participating developers.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
