OL,3,AEarnings limit of up to #140K for
OL,4,Afirst-time buyers loan scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe loans, which will also be subject
OL,7,Fto an initial interest-free period, are
OL,8,Fdesigned to help people buy a home with
OL,9,Fdeposits as low as 2.5%.
